WEBVTT

00:09:59.339 --> 00:10:04.419
more than 1.3 billion dollars
from these deals.

00:10:04.443 --> 00:10:06.672
That's almost twice

00:10:06.696 --> 00:10:12.312
the country's annual health
and education budget combined.

00:10:12.336 --> 00:10:14.938
And will the people of Congo,
will they ever get their money back?

00:10:14.962 --> 00:10:16.596
Well, the answer to that question,

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.490
and who was really involved
and what really happened,

00:10:18.514 --> 00:10:20.993
well that's going to probably
remain locked away

00:10:21.017 --> 00:10:24.142
in the secretive company registries
of the British Virgin Islands

00:10:24.166 --> 00:10:28.976
and elsewhere unless we all do
something about it.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.963
And how about the oil, gas
and mining companies?